{
  "_comment": "キット自身の開発セッション用。2026-09-19 に保守者の指示（日本語で報告／中間報告を今すぐ）を作業中に読み飛ばした事故の再発防止。配布形は 03_ClaudeCode/hooks/settings.json と export-project.sh。2026-09-20: 実体に届かない環境（リモートセッション／ディレクトリ移動の途中）で UserPromptSubmit が起動に失敗し、プロンプト投入ごとブロックされた。以後、実体が無ければ無言で飛ばす（回帰テストは 06_保守者向け/03_回帰テスト/test-hooks.sh の [.claude/settings.json 配線]）。全プロジェクトに効かせる本命は scripts/install-guard.sh（~/.claude/hooks/ に実体を置く）",
  "env": {
    "TZ": "Asia/Tokyo"
  },
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh -c 'f=\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/03_ClaudeCode/hooks/tool-timer.py\"; [ -f \"$f\" ] && exec python3 \"$f\" pre || exit 0'",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh -c 'f=\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/03_ClaudeCode/hooks/instruction-guard.py\"; [ -f \"$f\" ] && exec python3 \"$f\" || exit 0'",
            "timeout": 5,
            "statusMessage": "保守者の指示に応答済みか確認中"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh -c 'f=\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/03_ClaudeCode/hooks/tool-timer.py\"; [ -f \"$f\" ] && exec python3 \"$f\" post || exit 0'",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh -c 'f=\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/03_ClaudeCode/hooks/tool-timer.py\"; [ -f \"$f\" ] && exec python3 \"$f\" reset || exit 0'",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh -c 'f=\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/03_ClaudeCode/hooks/prompt-priority.py\"; [ -f \"$f\" ] && exec python3 \"$f\" || exit 0'",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh -c 'f=\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/03_ClaudeCode/hooks/reply-language.py\"; [ -f \"$f\" ] && exec python3 \"$f\" || exit 0'",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
